{"id":"84e605078c","t":"The Return of the Scorned Genius","c":"cv","n":30,"l":30,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius"},"u":1795376301428,"desc":"في عالمٍ تحدّد «المهن» فيه مصير البشر، كان تشي يوان عبقريًا فذًّا قبل أن تفقده مأساةٌ غامضة قواه وتلزمه كرسيًّا متحركًا. وبعد ثلاث سنوات، تنكسر أختامه خلال مراسم الصحوة، ويستيقظ على مهنة غامضة: «سيد الهاوية». مسلّحًا بقوته الجديدة وجنود الهاوية، ينطلق تشي يوان نحو القمة بحثًا عن والده المفقود، وسعيًا إلى دخول العالم السماوي.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","دراما","فانتازيا"],"src":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorned-genius|/manga/the-return-of-the-scorned-genius/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-return-of-the-scorn